Unified MathLang CLI; existing mathematical engines and immutable evidence

Usage: mathlang [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  model      
  verify     
  proof      
  knowledge  
  compare    
  evidence   
  solve      
  doctor     
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: text, json]
      --output <OUTPUT>  
      --config <CONFIG>  
      --quiet            
      --verbose          
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
